window.products.push({"id":623138,"name":"Egg slicer for hard boiled eggs heavy duty aluminum body and stainless steel wire, egg cutter use for soft vegetables and fruits, dishwasher safe, Sil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vftF+X0rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BRAND INTRODUCTION  Aizah kitchen is a premium Kitchen Essentials brand introduced to provide premium quality products for the best customer experience. We believe in providing the value our esteemed customers deserve.  PRODUCT   We have always dreamt of a light, sturdy and well made kitchen gadget. We decided to step to introduce Aizah egg slicer that would not only slices boiled eggs but also cuts soft vegetables and fruits with its highly sharp stainless steel wires fitted in its heavy duty aluminum body .  Why Aizah Egg Slicer?  MULTIPURPOSE  As we mentioned our metal egg slicer not only slices hard boiled eggs but also soft boiled eggs and any other fruits and vegetables which are soft like mushrooms, strawberries, banana, grapes which makes it pretty much multipurpose gadget and time saver too DURABLE  We choose the premium quality aluminum alloy and stainless steel to make egg slicer heavy duty body along with sharp irreplaceable and pressure resistible wires which are fitted in egg slicer body .  EASY TO WASH  Aizha kitchen hard boiled egg cutter is not only easy to clean but also dishwasher safe.  EFFICIENT SLICING   with sharp and pressure resistible stainless steel wires, it can slices dozens of boiled eggs and soft fruits and vegetables just in minutes.   Egg Slicer Dimensions: 3.1x8x13.94cm  Egg Slicer Weight: 140g  PACKAGE CONTAINS  1x Aizah kitchen Egg Slicer  MONEY BACK GUARANTEE  Being a customer-centric brand, we ensure the quality of products, as well as post-sales support. If you face any problem with our product, feel free to reach out to us, and we will provide you with the best solution including full returns. Our customers are our pride.  To avoid repeated frustration and have the experience you truly deserve at the cost you want, click the Buy Now button!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vftF+X0rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YIROCK","source_asin":"B09WCRJGV1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-623138","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WCRJGV1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WCRJGV1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
