window.products.push({"id":623201,"name":"4-in-1 Kitchen Knife Sharpener: 4-Stage Knife and Scissors Sharpener to Help Repair and Polish the Blades and Sharpen the Scissors, Non-Slip Base-come","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+tXpdc2xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Colour: Black Material: stainless steel Product size: 8.15*1.37*3.7 inches Product weight: 7.68 ounces Description of high hardness emery tungsten steel: When using, please place the sharpener on a stable surface. Depending on the bluntness of the blade, complete one or two of the following steps. Method 1 (scissors slot): Open the scissors and hold the handle firmly, then put the scissors blade into the slot, clamp the emery roller with appropriate manpower, and finally slide the scissors back several times. Method 2 (thick slot): Only use your knife when it is very blunt. Use a slight downward pressure to pass the blade through its root until it passes through the slot. (Only in one direction, do not move forward and backward.) Repeat three times, once every six months or as needed. Method 3 (fine groove): Always complete this step to eliminate the honing process due to re-edging and roughness. Without applying pressure, the blade was passed backward through the ceramic rod five times, and then moved forward from its heel to its tip. You can also use this step alone to maintain sharp blades. It is recommended to do it approximately once a week. Method 4 (precision grinding groove): Place the sharpener on a firm surface. Gently pull the knife out of the slot. From heel to tip, it can only move in one direction. Repeat twice or three times or until it becomes pointed. note: 1. Do not use a sharpener to serrate 2. To avoid damaging the knife, please sharpen the knife gently, not back and forth. 3. The ceramic rod may fade after use, which is normal. 4. Do not put the pencil sharpener in the dishwasher or immerse in water 5. Please keep the sharpener and the knife out of the reach of children to avoid any accidents. Looking for a sharpener? Our sharpener is your best choice. Because our sharpener uses professional hard materials, ergonomic design","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+tXpdc2xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Llyiuany","source_asin":"B08P86DZ52","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-623201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P86DZ52","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P86DZ52","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
