window.products.push({"id":623273,"name":"Stainless Steel Fresh Coconut Opener Tool with Hammer Utensil Set | Professional Food Grade Young Coconut Opening Kit | Make Easy Coconut Water | Dura","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NguR-0hgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description: Always be ready to serve delicious and fresh coconut water to your guests and family by ordering our superior Coconut Opener Tool! The 2-piece set includes a cutter with a sharp, round edge that pounds into the top of the coconut’s flesh with the use of the rubber mallet. It creates a smooth cut with a large diameter of a hole, great for scooping out the flesh! The pair of tools works synergistically and feature ergonomic handles to make the process practically effortless! This also means a safer cutting experience, so you end up cutting the coconut and not yourself! Never use a sharp knife again to cut through the tough outer shell of a coconut. With our coconut opening kit, it’s as easy as 1, 2, 3! Please note, with this set, you may receive either a black hammer or a yellow one. They are the same great quality! If you’ve been searching for the best gift for the person who has everything, we think our coconut opening tool is one item, he or she probably doesn’t have, but would use often! Give it as a wedding present or as a housewarming or hostess gift! Purchase your coconut opener set today! We’ll ship it to you fast so you’ll quickly be enjoying the delicious taste of the freshest coconut water or shredded fresh coconut in your salads! Yum!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NguR-0hgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ProvenWare","source_asin":"B07D8G77PT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-623273","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D8G77PT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D8G77PT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":623274,"name":"Tupperware Set of 5 16 0z. Flip Top Tumblers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31XFNgRxkbL._AC_.jpg","description":"Tupperware Set of 5 16 0z. Flip Top Tumblers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31XFNgRxkbL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tupperware","source_asin":"B00ELOE8T0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-623274","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ELOE8T0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ELOE8T0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":623275,"name":"BonJour Copper Clad 2.5-Quart Covered Saucier","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6179Pa0XhaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BonJour’s collection of clad cookware offers precise control over the cooking process with an elegant, European flair. Clad metal construction is the preferred fabrication by professional and home chefs alike. The interior layer of each pan is crafted of pure 18/10 stainless steel which is non-reactive and doesn’t adversely affect the flavor of delicate ingredients or subtle sauces. The exterior is made of magnetized steel which is induction suitable and polished to a beautiful mirror finish. The key to clad cookware is the heat conductive metal core layered in between the stainless steel throughout the entire pan. BonJour’s unique design offers better heat conduction than traditional clad cookware because its thicker base evenly directs the heat up the side walls and around the pan. The result is stunning cookware that heats up quickly and evenly and provides a lifetime of exceptional performance. The culinary heritage that introduced buttery, delicate sauces and bold, lush wines reinvents itself in new clad cookware from BonJour. Time-honored tradition and attention to detail made these quintessentially French delights international favorites. The same care and commitment to excellence can be found in BonJour’s clad collection, which is why it’s the preferred cookware in the famed Eiffel Tower restaurant. With its bold silhouettes, generously appointed fittings and exceptional performance, they will be your favored culinary tools as well.The 2.5 qt saucier pan is perfect for risotto and all sauces. Its rounded base allows for easy whisking and the wide diameter speeds the reduction time for sauces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6179Pa0XhaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BonJour","source_asin":"B001H0ETUE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-623275","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001H0ETUE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001H0ETUE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
