window.products.push({"id":623374,"name":"PYY Chafing Dish with Serving Tong Buffet Set Half Size Rectangular Chafer for Catering Buffet Warmeri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wXHaHiJxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High Quality Stainless Steel-PYY rectangle chafing dish buffet set is made of high quality stainless steel.Safety and rust-proof, not easy to corrode or tarnish.Our chafing dishes for buffet allows cuisine being in best taste.Suitable as catering food warmers, buffet servers and warmers for restaurants, buffet, hotel, holiday gathering, wedding brunch, picnics. Open and Close Smoothly with Ease-PYY chafer dish with sleek handle and upgraded buffer hydraulic bearing opens and closes smoothly. The lid can rotate up with ease instead of having to lift off . When the lid is less than a certain angle, it will slowly close. That's great because it means guests don't have to fumble around with lids, don't have to look for someplace to set it aside while getting food or you don't have to leave room for it on the table. Visible Glass Window and Protective Cover- Our buffet servers and warmers with visible glass window lid, give people a preview of what's inside without having to lift the dish. That way if they don't really want what's inside they don't need to lift the lid. This helps keep food inside warmer longer. the whole chafing dish just looks very elegant and classy. Easy to Wash and Clean-PYY chafing dish is rust-resistant and ensures long durability, is easy to clean and maintain with dishwashing liquid, bringing a clean and tidy appearance. With the polished finish type, our chaffing serving set can protect itself from corrosion and enhances durability. Prior to first use, they need to be washed in hot soapy water and then dried with a soft towel. Attention of Using-The chafing buffet server set chafer for catering or restaurant Large Capacity with 2 Pans, 9 Quart -the chafing dish buffet set with a food tong ,and includes 2X Half Size Steam Pans(2.7\" Deep), 1X Water Pan(4\"Deep), 1X Stable Base. The perfect choice for catering and food service. Warm Tips: please pour enough hot water into the pan, then put the food pan on the water pan, ensure heating more evenly and long time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wXHaHiJxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PYY","source_asin":"B09G9BHCPH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-623374","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G9BHCPH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G9BHCPH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":623375,"name":"XKY Bathroom Rug, Non-Slip Bath Mats, Extra Soft Absorbent Soft Cozy Shaggy Durable Bath Rug for Tub, Shower, Bath Room, Machine Wash and Dry - 16\"x 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ynLr4YR4L._AC_.jpg","description":"Soft and Thick: XKY bath mats are constructed of 1.18\" tall premium thick and soft microfiber with a unique fiber locking technology that is thicker and better constructed than most other brands. Non Slip Rubber Backing: We use the more expensive TP Rubber backing (not PVC or glue) which is much stronger and durable for long lasting use, unlike other brands where the rubber backing tends to wear and peel off after a number of washes. Note: Do not place mat on wet surface. Make sure floors are dry underneath the rug to prevent the rug from slipping. Ultra Absorbent: Extra soft shaggy microfiber fabric helps save your floors from dripping water while you're stepping out of the bath, shower, or getting ready by the sink. Moisture is trapped in the mat's deep pile, allowing the rug to dry quickly and cleanly. Easy Cleaning: XKY bathroom mats are easy to clean. Machine wash separately in cold water with a mild detergent (no chlorine or bleach) and tumble dry or hang dry on low. No fading. Multi-Purpose Use: The unique bath rug can be widely used in various occasions, such as bathroom, kitchen, living room, meeting room, study room, hallway, bedroom, balcony, bathtub side or anywhere else you want to support and warm your toes. A great gift for all occasions; Christmas, weddings, Father's Day, Mother's Day, Valentine's Day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ynLr4YR4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XKY","source_asin":"B0BKG2VGWP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-623375","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKG2VGWP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKG2VGWP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
