window.products.push({"id":623406,"name":"Hayley Cherie - White Gift Card Box with Rhinestone Slider, Cards Label & 7 Ribbon Colors - Large Size 10\" x 10\" - for Weddings, Baby Showers, Birthda","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XwLr2sTEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEAUTIFUL - This square wedding card box is beautifully made with a subtle textured design and high quality finish. It is a soft white color (not stark white) and comes with 7 colored ribbons, cards label and rhinestone slider as optional accessories. The finish and feel is to a very high standard and the box is designed to last with it's sturdy construction. HIGHEST QUALITY - Made with premium materials, including durable 0.16in (4mm) grey paper board and a specialty textured paper. This unique embossed paper is very finely detailed and looks similar to fabric. The white satin ribbon and a silver rhinestone ribbon slider are unattached if you choose not to use them. The cards label has double sided tape on the back so it can be attached to the box easily.. VERSATILE - Ideal for all types of events such as weddings, parties, anniversaries, baptisms, graduations and baby showers. Not only is this perfect for collecting gift cards, it can also be used as a keepsake box to store cards and memorabilia. This box is easy to personalize by adding your own decorative touch, such as colored ribbons or flowers to match your theme or occasion. ORIGINAL DESIGN BY HAYLEY CHERIE - Our unique foldable design was created so that the box will pop into shape for simple assembly. It is constructed to fit perfectly together, so there are no gaps around the base and lid. Included with the box are adhesive strips to secure the box tightly together. The box can also be used without the adhesive if you wish to fold the box up again for easy storage. SOLID & STURDY - It is made with extra thick paper board, making it extremely durable and tough. It has been tested to hold over 6 pounds (3kg) of weight and can hold 100+ cards. The box dimensions are: 10.2\" x 10.2\" x 10.2\" (26cm x 26cm x 26cm). It is designed to last long after your special day or occasion so you can make use of this box for many years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XwLr2sTEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hayley Cherie","source_asin":"B00M2UXO8G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-623406","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00M2UXO8G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00M2UXO8G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
