window.products.push({"id":623457,"name":"Polart Polish Wooden Butter Mold - Rectangle Container, Hand Carved for Christmas/Easter Table Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oUex5YVcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Polart Polish Wooden Butter Mold is a beautifully crafted rectangular container, hand-carved from high-quality, natural wood. This unique butter mold is designed to bring a touch of old-world charm to your Christmas or Easter table setting. The mold features intricate, traditional Polish designs that have been carved into the wood, creating a stunning visual display. Its rectangular shape is perfect for molding butter into a classic block shape, allowing you to easily cut and serve perfect slices. Crafted from solid wood, this butter mold is durable and built to last. The natural wood finish gives it a rustic feel that will add warmth and character to any table setting. Whether you're hosting a festive holiday gathering or simply looking for a unique decorative piece, the Polart Polish Wooden Butter Mold is the perfect addition to your home. It's a functional and beautiful piece that will add a touch of elegance and charm to your holiday celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oUex5YVcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polish Accessories","source_asin":"B003HF9Q5U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-623457","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003HF9Q5U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003HF9Q5U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":623458,"name":"Wilton Armetale Reggae Bread Serving Tray, Rectangular, 6-1/2-Inch by 9-1/2-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MBHPZ81WL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description WILTON ARMETALE offers a creative way to cook and serve every day. This uniquely designed Bread Serving Tray is from our popular Reggae collection. The designs in this collection are evocative of the rhythms of the Caribbean. All of our pieces are designed for both decorative and practical use making them appropriate for parties, dinners or simply everyday use. Constructed of 100% recycled food-safe aluminum based alloy, Wilton Armetale cookware and serveware will not rust, crack, chip, dent, or tarnish. Bring our pieces straight to the table for an attractive presentation that keeps food hotter longer. Our metal has been independently tested and approved for both cooking and serving food. You can also pre-chill to use for condiments, cheeses, crudités, dips, and more. Unit measures 6-1/2-inch by 9-1/2-inch by 1-inch. To clean, hand wash with hot soapy water and towel dry. Do not put in the microwave or dishwasher. With proper care your Armetale treasures can last a lifetime. A family-owned company since 1892, Wilton Armetale offers a vast array of cookware and serveware designed to capture the spirit of your life. Amazon.com Since 1892, Wilton Armetale has constructed unique serving pieces in silver and pewter, gracefully combining beauty and durability. Individually handcrafted in Lancaster, Pennsylvania, no two pieces are exactly alike. Non-toxic metal ensures the safety of all food items, and effectively keeps a side dish or main course at the desired temperature. Wilton Armetale guarantees that under normal circumstances, serveware pieces will not rust, tarnish, crack, chip, or dent. Designed to evoke the ambiance of the Caribbean, the Reggae pattern is extremely contemporary and artistic while also being playful and quirky. With spacious rims, rounded corners, and flowing lines, each tableware piece adds a comfortable feel to the table. The etched pattern varies on each item, yet the elements remain constant, combining spirals, zigzags, stars, and circles in a uniquely organic way. Measuring 6-1/2 by 9-1/2 inches, this bread tray complements other tableware pieces in the same pattern. Cheerful swirls, zigzags, and a large star adorn the inner serving area, while rounded corners and curving lines soften the design. For best results, Wilton Armetale recommends washing all serving pieces by hand, and instructs users not to place them in the microwave or dishwasher. --Lea Werbel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MBHPZ81WL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wilton Armetale","source_asin":"B0000CGCNN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-623458","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000CGCNN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000CGCNN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
