window.products.push({"id":623559,"name":"Yikla Adhesive Hooks, Bathroom Wall Towel Hooks, Black Stick Shower Razor Holder, Stainless Steel Door Hangers for Coat Loofah Robes Self Adhesive Org","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rgWJRYeLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specification: Material: SUS 304 Stainless SteelFinish: Black plating matt surfacePackage includes: 2 PCS HooksMulti-function hook：Widely used in the bathroom, kitchen, toolhouse, entryway, and hallway as coat hooks, clothes hangers, cooking tools hooks, towel hooks, hardware tool hooks to hang coats, bathrobes, towels, hats, scarves, keys, utensils, bags, loofahs and so on. How to install: 1.Wipe dust, grease, and water of the installation position(the hook must be pasted on smooth surfaces, like ceramic tile, mirror, flat metals, woods, plastic surfaces, glasses, etc, not suitable for wallpaper or painted wall).2.Peel off the back protective film of the pad( Don't touch the glue side to avoid dust or grease).3.Stick hooks on the smooth wall and press the product plate with some force to drain the air completely. (Make sure the position to stick on one time.)4.Waiting for 24 hours before hanging anything to ensure that the product is firmly fixed and secured. How to remove: Heat the glue with a hairdryer, then slowly remove it from the side without leaving a trace(Re-use the removed hook will significantly decrease the load capacity). Notes: 1. Do not hang overweight, expensive, or fragile products.2. Do not use it in high-temperature environment.3. Applicable to all kinds of smooth surfaces, such as ceramic tile, marble, mirror, flat metals, woods, plastic surfaces, glasses, etc.4. Our wall hooks are very sticky, Do not use on easily peelable wall surfaces. For instance, drywall, wallpaper, paint, painted walls, and rough surfaces, it might be damaged while hanging things.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rgWJRYeLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yikla","source_asin":"B09PTSV9VY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-623559","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PTSV9VY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PTSV9VY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
