window.products.push({"id":623714,"name":"Premium Australian Hardwood Chopping Board End Grain Butcher Block Rectangular 20 Inches x 13 Inches x 1.5 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ncMWLu0eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For generations artisans have been working with beautiful Tasmanian timbers. And so the tradition continues with Big Chop. Each chopping board has been designed and crafted in Tasmania, Australia by the hand of a skilled tradesman using traditional artisan techniques. Our skilled artisans use these woods to handcraft superb chopping boards that harness the natural beauty of the woods – no two boards are the same . Timbers have been carefully selected to make each board unique. Aesthetically beautiful, they're durable, kind to knives, and are a feature in kitchens all over the world including the great Jamie Oliver. The Derwent collection are made from 5 iconic Tasmanian timbers: Blackwood (pale brown to bark brown) Blackwood (pale brown to bark brown) Celery Top (creamy white to pale yellow) Celery Top (creamy white to pale yellow) Myrtle (rich red brown) Myrtle (rich red brown) Sassafras (olive green with black highlight) Sassafras (olive green with black highlight) Tasmanian Oak (straw to reddish brown) Tasmanian Oak (straw to reddish brown) These premium timbers are sourced from sustainably-managed and PEFC certified temperate forests of the north-west region of Tasmania, Australia.  Big Chop timber chopping boards and butcher blocks are recommended by premium knife manufacturers as they are kind to your knife blades. Knives and our boards are best friends. This board is a large 20 x 13 x 1.5 inches thick and would be ideal for heavy duty use. It makes for the perfect Wedding present, Anniversary gift or Birthday present/gift. With the timeless beauty of natural timber and high quality construction, and if the board is cared for, it is sure to become a future family heirloom. For information on “Seasoning” and caring for your new Big Chop Board, please see our website.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ncMWLu0eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Derwent40","source_asin":"B07SK1X523","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-623714","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SK1X523","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SK1X523","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
