window.products.push({"id":623792,"name":"Floral White Sage Organic Smudge Sticks with Flowers 3 Pack for Cleansing Home, Meditation, Yoga, Healing and Smudging | Sustainably Sourced Californi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kMdfIXiGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DAHLIA FLORAL SAGE is blend of white sage, purple daisies and mirton leaves. Combined with the energetic properties of white sage, the purple daisies promote love and beauty while thoroughly cleansing and renewing places, people and things. Effective in countering negativity, reversing curses & jinxes, spiritual healing, boosting health, & improving business. SAGE sourced responsibly in California proven to neutralize negative vibrations, improve sleep, as well as alleviate anxiety and stress. When burned the smoke heals and brings one back into balance and cleanses the body and mind of negative spirits and impurities. PRACTICE A SACRED TRADITION Sage is a traditional medicine plant of the Native American peoples, used for healing and ceremony. It is used for cleansing and purification, and to open people up to a greater connection with the sacred. It is thought to banish negative energy, not only on the physical level, but also emotionally, mentally and spiritually. Sage has a very aromatic, sharp and stimulating smell, and its action works on all the senses. USE FOR YOGA AND MEDITATION Smudging with sage is a powerful tool in spiritual practice. Burning sage improves awareness and focus. It commonly used to practice mindfulness and transcendental meditation. THE ESSENTIAL SMUDGE GUIDE Smudging how-to written in layman's terms. This essential guide details everything you will need to know to become a shaman-level smudging pro. FAMILY OWNED AND OPERATED: Purchase with confidence from a supplier you can trust! Our family has been in business since 1993, and 30 years later we continue to proudly offer only the best in incense products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kMdfIXiGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ancientveda","source_asin":"B09TSM6S7N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-623792","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TSM6S7N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TSM6S7N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
