window.products.push({"id":623833,"name":"BOF Vinyl siding Hooks(10 Pack)，Heavy Duty Stainless Steel Vinyl Siding Hangers for Hanging Ornaments, Wreaths, Camera, String Lights, Wreath Pictures","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FnwTD9qOL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"✅Waterproof Heavy Duty Wall Hooks : Made of high quality of 304 stainless steel. Able to resist daily scratches, corrosions, tarnish and rust. urability, no deformed with long-lasting service life. They will never damage stain or rust your vinyl siding. ✅Heavyweight Support : Vinyl siding clips have passed factory test of 60 lb weight max loading. these vinyl siding clips allows you to maximize your siding space decoration with signs, plaques, lights, ornaments, holiday/seasonal decorations and more.Will never fall off/ down or damage your vinyl siding. ✅Easy to Install : Simply roll the bend part into any seam of vinyl siding of your house. NO drilling, NO screws, NO holes or tools required. Simple to use, easy to remove and relocate. ✅Widely Used Sticky Hooks : This hook set contains 10 Vinyl Siding Hooks, suitable for plants, wreath, signs, wooden plaques, outdoor lights, ornaments, holiday decorations and more. Perfect tools for adding vivid colors on your walls during parties and festivals. Not recommended to hang fragile, expensive items. ✅After-sales Service : We are striving to provide high-quality siding hooks and excellent customer service. Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions about vinyl siding hooks. After purchasing our products, you can enjoy a 180-day return service and a 365-day warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FnwTD9qOL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOF Creations","source_asin":"B07YXHQWCS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-623833","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YXHQWCS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YXHQWCS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":623834,"name":"GenMous & Co. Farmhouse Tiered Tray, Beaded White Tiered Tray for Rustic Home Decor, Two Tiered Serving Tray Stand for Kitchen, Party, Birthday Displa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510HO9UyisL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✿STURDY & EASY ASSEMBLING: Our wooden tiered tray is made by high quality wood which is sturdy and durable. Improved metal stick ensures the stability of the farmhouse tiered tray. Three wood ball feet on the bottom-stable while protect your table from being scratched. Follow the assembling instruction in the package to assemble the two tiered tray without tools within 2 minutes. ✿LARGE SPACE & PERFECT SIZE: Bottom tiered tray diameter is 11-1/4in and top tiered tray diameter is 9-1/4in. The space between both trays is 7-1/2in, allowing for versatile displaying. Total height is 15-3/4in which works perfectly as an under cabinet piece in the kitchen. Use the rustic farmhouse decor tiered tray separately as a single tray for a centerpiece or dress it up for the Holidays. ✿FARMHOUSE TIERED TRAY DECOR: This beautiful two tiered tray stand is supper great for your farmhouse kitchen decor, coffee table decor, rustic home style decor. The farmhouse tiered tray is surely an eye catching and a conversation starter piece as it comes with unique bead accents around each tray. Place it as a centerpiece on your kitchen counter, dining table and MORE! ✿GORGEOUS BEADED TIERED TRAY: Fill your house with farmhouse accents that makes you feel right at home! Our farmhouse tiered tray stand features white wash finished with wood texture and a little rustic touch on the bead accents which is perfect for rustic farmhouse decor, kitchen island decor and farmhouse table centerpieces. Get the cozy farmhouse tiered tray feel today. ✿PERFECT HOLIDAY GIFT FOR ANY OCCASION: Give our special beaded two tiered tray to your special ONES! Perfect holiday gift for Birthdays, Thanks Giving, Christmas, Weddings, Anniversaries, Parties, Office, House Warming etc. Also nice addition to your kitchen counter, dinning table, coffee table, entry way and MORE!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510HO9UyisL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GENMOUS & CO.","source_asin":"B09M8N3WR1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-623834","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M8N3WR1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M8N3WR1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
