window.products.push({"id":623844,"name":"Silver Birthday Candles 45 Pack - Dripless Decorating Candle for Centerpiece Holders, Cakes and Parties - Elegant Taper Design, 5.5” Tall - by Hyoola ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FeaQmNbvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The best part of celebrating your child's birthdays is watching their faces filled with excitement as they make a wish and blow out the candles. Nothing could ever replace the magic of birthday candles in anyone's childhood and Hyoola is here to give your child that feeling with gold and silver candles! PRODUCT FEATURES Pack of 45 Decorative Candles 5.5\" Tall, 5/16th\" Diameter Dripless Burning (Keep upright, without wind or draft) Available in Gold & Silver Great for Birthday Cakes, Cupcakes, Chanukah and Candle Holders ELEGANTLY FESTIVE Provide a wonderful display at your son or daughter's birthday party no matter what age they become with our birthday candles! They're beautifully crafted to provide a sleek and chic touch to any birthday celebration. Available in 2 vibrant colors that are fit for any situation, place them on any kid's favorite flavor cake and have him or her blow them out for great celebratory excitement! They're the perfect size to fit on cake tops without them looking to bulky or too thin. HIGH QUALITY Avoid unnecessary wax from leaking onto your desserts with our candles! They're optimally designed to create as little wax spillage as possible so you can ensure a healthier cake eating experience for your children and guests. They also last a pretty long time - over 30 minutes burning time so it's great for surprise parties! ALL PURPOSE USE These decorative candles are not only good for use in birthday cakes, they can be used to decorate all kids of parties and events in centerpieces and many types of candle holders, They can also be used in Chanukah menorahs and for other religious events and ceremonies Try the best in quality and performance with Hyoola today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FeaQmNbvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hyoola","source_asin":"B07BFHTMND","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-623844","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BFHTMND","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BFHTMND","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
