window.products.push({"id":623883,"name":"Boveda Portable Travel 2-Way Humidity Resealable Bag – Waterproof & Dustproof - Preloaded with 69% RH Pack - Patented Technology – Medium Storage For ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zzQoWX9uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PORTABLE STORAGE BAG: Lightweight, portable, and space-saving design is a special feature for travel and outdoor activities. As soon as you take sticks out of a storage box, fluctuating humidity levels cause sticks to lose essential oils and flavors. Protects sticks wherever you’re headed out for the evening, day tripping, boating, skiing, weddings, birthdays, graduations, golfing, or camping. Safeguards souvenir sticks to or from your stick vacation. REUSABLE & RESEALABLE BAG: Preloaded with patented Boveda the RH pack uses all-natural salt and water to ensure an exact 69% Relative Humidity (RH) inside this high-tech storage bag. A simple touch test will let you know when it’s time to replace Boveda—it will feel crunchy and rigid. Our airtight seal will make you feel confident traveling with your sticks! Not just for travel though a great gift for a new stick hobbyist, smart-priced second storage or first stop for conditioning new sticks. HOW IT WORKS: Our patented two-way humidity controlled Boveda packs compensate the atmosphere inside your storage box. When water vapor is needed, Boveda releases the cleanest and most purified humidity. When there is too much moisture in your storage box, Boveda absorbs the excess. With Boveda, you do not have to adjust any valves or figure out if you put in too much or too little water and you will never have to fill or refill your device with water again - ever. PRECISE HUMIDITY CONTROL: Automatically restores and maintains humidity in any type of stick storage—desktop storage, cabinet storage, travel storage, wineadors, coolerdors and tupperdors. You’ll experience a new stick experience with Boveda-Protected packets. Boveda’s patented formula uses all-natural salt and water to ensure an exact Relative Humidity (RH). Choose from four different RH (65%, 69%, 72% and 75%) and place Boveda in your container and close the lid—it’s that easy. ABOUT US: Boveda devoted the past 23 years to the science of two-way humidity control, we know you will benefit from our commitment to precision. Becoming the global leader in any category does not happen overnight, but Boveda did this and continues to do so since 1997. Today, that persistence looks like millions of two-way humidity control packets getting shipped out each year to protect your finest sticks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zzQoWX9uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boveda","source_asin":"B00I3D3WBA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-623883","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I3D3WBA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I3D3WBA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
