window.products.push({"id":623985,"name":"Puzatur Advent Calendar 2022 Bracelets Making Kit 24 Days Countdown Christmas Advent Calendar Jewelry Making Kit with 22 DIY Charm Beads and 2 Bracele","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C-NPpZtvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COUNTDOWN TO CHRISTMAS GIFT: The Christmas jewelry bracelet making kit comes in a Christmas countdown box with small “window” from December 1st to Christmas Eve, this will keep your little ones excited and looking forward to open each of the surprises day by day, more exciting than traditional chocolate or candy calendar. A gift each day till Christmas. How fun to countdown Christmas. CHRISTMAS BRACELET CALENDAR: You will receive a Christmas advent calendar with 22 Charm Beads and 2 Bracelet Chains to make 2 Christmas bracelets; The adorable charms are all the theme of Christmas like Santa Claus, Christmas tree, Santa hat, gift box, stocking, snowflake, wreath, candy cane, etc and none duplicates, exquisite and delicate. CHRISTMAS CRAFTS: The Christmas jewelry advent calendar provide your kids a daily arts & crafts activity for each day of the 24 days before Christmas, this would be the most attractive feature for girls, they’re freely to make their own Xmas bracelets at their preferences and wear them on Christmas day. PREMIUM MATERIAL: Christmas charm beads and pendant are well made of non-toxic plastic and environmental alloy, safe to kids, resistant, not easy to fade; The length of the bracelet ideal for girls arms. EASY TO DIY BRACELETS: The bracelet chain features a barrel charm clasp and innovative threading system, easy to create your own bracelets and change every time you want.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C-NPpZtvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Puzatur","source_asin":"B0BF978FJQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-623985","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF978FJQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF978FJQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
